      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_20",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/frontier.webp"),
            text: _("Baldras’ journal, 6 Deeproot, 501 YW: Me and Harper visited Erwen’s grave today. I helped the lass pick her a bunch of flowers — we even found some of her favorite, blue lilies. Harper don’t remember her much, but still thinks lots about her. Lass reminds me so much of her ma often times, real bright and brassy, even if she don’t got the same sense or wits. I’m just hoping she be learning more with time."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
