          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("<i>Uncle, since when did we have a queen?</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("<i>Since a few years back, I thinks, but weren’t never her giving out no orders...</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("<i>It don’t really matter right now. Harper, get yerself out o’ here. This be no kind of battle for you.</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("I can fight!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("<i>Harper, do what I says to ya.</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("We’re in this together. Death to the Wesnothians!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("Impulsive lass..."),
          },
