      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_11",
        on: "enemies_defeated",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Advisor",
            text: _("We beat their leader, but a couple of them riders escaped. What should we do?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("Somethin’ be very wrong here. That Garard weren’t never no hero or nothing, but his men never would’ve attacked us. The Queen must’ve did something to him."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("We’ve got to tell the people of Delwyn about this. Ol’ magistrate Relana will have some ideas."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Advisor",
            text: _("That’s true. Whenever there’s been troubles, we’ve always looked to her for help."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("Fine. We’ll go to Delwyn, see what Relana gots to say. With them riders so eagerly attackin’ us today, I’m thinking Delwyn will be under threat too."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("So we’ll have to fight them Wesnothians again?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("Alls I can say for certain is we’ve made ourselves enemies of the Crown. They’ll be hunting us now."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("Then we’re outlaws."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("Aye, outlaws."),
          },
